        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The probability of things happening in that statement approaches zero toward the end. :B</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Today's adventures in \"I can't believe we're dating in this universe\".</p>\n<p>And bringing up Vogel's baton (along with the questions of how it'd function and be an instrument of good influence there), also points out that Biomancer would be a good guy in this universe…</p>",
